      "id": "as_count_go",
      "type": "JavaScriptFunction",
      "label": "Count unread: as the learner, or as the coach",
      "parameters": {
        "runOnChange-in-coach": false,
        "functionScript": "// On mount and on every doorbell (a message, or one read): the count on this side's tab.\n// Only for someone signed in: a signed-out visitor sees a page for a beat before the gate (/App)\n// sends them to Sign in, and a count asked for then is refused (403).\nif (!Noodl.Users.Current) return;\nif (Inputs.coach === true) Outputs.countCoach(); else Outputs.countLearner();"
